{
  "sn28.10:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 28.10 ",
  "sn28.10:0.2": "1. Sāriputtavagga ",
  "sn28.10:0.3": "Sucimukhīsutta ",
  "sn28.10:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ āyasmā sāriputto rājagahe viharati veḷuvane kalandakanivāpe. ",
  "sn28.10:1.2": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya rājagahe piṇḍāya pāvisi. ",
  "sn28.10:1.3": "Rājagahe sapadānaṁ piṇḍāya caritvā taṁ piṇḍapātaṁ aññataraṁ kuṭṭamūlaṁ nissāya paribhuñjati. ",
  "sn28.10:1.4": "Atha kho sucimukhī paribbājikā yenāyasmā sāriputto tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmantaṁ sāriputtaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn28.10:2.1": "“Kiṁ nu kho, samaṇa, adhomukho bhuñjasī”ti? ",
  "sn28.10:2.2": "“Na khvāhaṁ, bhagini, adhomukho bhuñjāmī”ti. ",
  "sn28.10:2.3": "“Tena hi, samaṇa, ubbhamukho bhuñjasī”ti? ",
  "sn28.10:2.4": "“Na khvāhaṁ, bhagini, ubbhamukho bhuñjāmī”ti. ",
  "sn28.10:2.5": "“Tena hi, samaṇa, disāmukho bhuñjasī”ti? ",
  "sn28.10:2.6": "“Na khvāhaṁ, bhagini, disāmukho bhuñjāmī”ti. ",
  "sn28.10:2.7": "“Tena hi, samaṇa, vidisāmukho bhuñjasī”ti? ",
  "sn28.10:2.8": "“Na khvāhaṁ, bhagini, vidisāmukho bhuñjāmī”ti. ",
  "sn28.10:3.1": "“‘Kiṁ nu, samaṇa, adhomukho bhuñjasī’ti iti puṭṭho samāno ‘na khvāhaṁ, bhagini, adhomukho bhuñjāmī’ti vadesi. ",
  "sn28.10:3.2": "‘Tena hi, samaṇa, ubbhamukho bhuñjasī’ti iti puṭṭho samāno ‘na khvāhaṁ, bhagini,